OL,3,GNEWSARaising #135k for baby loss
OL,4,Acharity was 'magical'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man behind a fundraiser that
OL,7,Fcollected #135,000 for a baby loss
OL,8,Fcharity said knowing it will make a
OL,9,Fdifference was "spine-tingling" and
OL,10,F"magical".
OL,12,FCarlos Baldry organised the Rust Bucket
OL,13,FRally, which involved drivers motoring
OL,14,Ffrom Northamptonshire to 10 different
OL,15,Fcountries in cars bought for under
OL,16,F#1,000.
OL,18,FThe money will help fund a new two-year
OL,19,Fcounselling service by baby loss
OL,20,Fbereavement charity, Petals, which
OL,21,Fstarted at Northampton and Kettering
OL,22,FGeneral hospitals in July.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
